Modifications (GPL-3.0 section 5(a)), made by KangRio, 2026-10-29
-----------------------------------------------------------------
- Renamed the application to GStore.
- Changed the application ID and namespace from com.aurora.store to
  com.kangrio.gstore; moved Kotlin/Java packages com.aurora.store,
  com.aurora.extensions and com.aurora.Constants to com.kangrio.gstore.*;
  renamed the classes AuroraApp, AuroraDatabase and AuroraListItem to
  GStoreApp, GStoreDatabase and GStoreListItem.
- Replaced the product name in user-visible strings (all locales), store
  listing texts and the README; added a fork notice to the About dialog.
- Replaced the launcher icons, in-app logo, notification icon and TV banner
  with new GStore artwork (branding/gstore-logo.svg); the Aurora Store logo
  is no longer included.
- Added this NOTICE file and an annotation for it in REUSE.toml.

